# pyenv
#   For a library or app, you might want to share your .python-version.
#   Otherwise, uncomment the next line:
# .python-version

# pipenv
#   According to pypa/pipenv#598, it is recommended to include Pipfile.lock in version control.
#   However, in case of collaboration, if delegates have different OS, they may get conflicts.
#   In that case, uncomment the next line:
# Pipfile.lock

# poetry
#   Similar to Pipfile.lock, poetry.lock contains specific versions of dependencies
#   installed. Only uncomment if you want to lock dependencies.
# poetry.lock

# pdm
#   Similar to Pipfile.lock, pdm.lock contains specific versions of dependencies
#   installed. Only uncomment if you want to lock dependencies.
# pdm.lock

# PEP 582; project local packages directory (used by pdm)
__pypackages__/

